<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντρέφω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιτ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέφω ἐν</span>
			, <i>bring up</i> or <i>train in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1428
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιθρέψασ᾽ ὀροδάμνοις βότρυας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.231
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτὰ ἐνθρέψασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					781
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be raised</i> or <i>bred in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάσια οἷσιν ἐνετράφην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					368
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.184
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					798a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιήμασι, ἤθει,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.32e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				38b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλογισμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					4.4.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς λόγοις τῆς πίστεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
					4.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
